WEBVTT

00:08:00.309 --> 00:08:04.647
It is one of the largest intact
forests left on the planet.

00:08:05.564 --> 00:08:09.568
Having guardians on the ground
will help us sustain so many species

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:14.532
like caribou, salmon, moose,
wolverine, lynx, songbirds,

00:08:14.532 --> 00:08:17.535
medicinal plants
and countless other species --

00:08:17.576 --> 00:08:21.413
species that are unfortunately threatened
in much of the rest of the world.

00:08:22.706 --> 00:08:26.293
They also help protect some
of the largest protected areas

00:08:26.335 --> 00:08:27.670
on the planet.

00:08:28.087 --> 00:08:29.588
You may not know this,

00:08:29.588 --> 00:08:33.592
but some of the biggest, most ambitious
plans to protect areas in Canada